    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Daylight condition re-inspection against pickup photos must be conducted in natural lighting to eliminate shadows and artificial color distortion. The delivery personnel will systematically compare the current exterior and interior state of the motorcycle with the baseline photographic records captured at origin.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
