    <span>Attention is directed toward panel alignment, mirror positioning, tire tread wear, exhaust condition, and any newly visible scratches, dents, or fluid leaks</span>
  </li>
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
