</div>
   <p>Adhering to this standardized handover framework protects all parties involved, reduces post-delivery disputes, and ensures transparent documentation from origin to final destination. Proper execution reinforces operational accountability and upholds industry best practices for two-wheeler logistics management.</p></div>
